### C.jet_secp_mixed_affine_product.mixed_affine_product_foot
mixed_affine_product_foot
     : forall (y : bool) (bo ba bb bx : Values.block) (pos : BinNums.Z)
         (_ : jet_sx_state.foot
                (@cons (prod Values.block BinNums.Z) (@pair Values.block BinNums.Z bo BinNums.Z0)
                   (@cons (prod Values.block BinNums.Z) (@pair Values.block BinNums.Z ba BinNums.Z0)
